<title>USA: Imagyn says FDA approves MicroLap Gold.</title>
<headline>Imagyn says FDA approves MicroLap Gold.</headline>
<dateline>LAGUNA NIGUEL, Calif. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imagyn Medical Inc said Wednesday the Food and Drug Administration had approved its microlaparoscope, called MicroLap Gold, which is used to diagnose and treat pelvic pain, infertility and tubal ligation.</p>
<p>U.S. Surgical Corp will distribute MicroLap Gold on a co-exclusive basis in the United States and exclusively outside the U.S.</p>
<p>Imagyn said it expects to begin shipments to U.S. Surgical in the second quarter.</p>
</text>
